  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "Baked face: glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with an amber-brown iris, a big navy pupil, two catchlights and the upper lash line; the thick navy brows and the nostrils baked into the body. The grin is modelled open (a real mouth with a rose palate and a pink tongue painted inside), small rounded teeth on both rims (props on the head and the jaw); the jaw opens it wider in the smiles and the strikes. No face sheet and no morphs. Blinking scales the blink bones: each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head. The fan crest and the spines glow sunflower gold (ORM alpha). The bracers' carved suns glow gold too.",
